# The line has the editing keys of the other one-line fields: here, left and backspace
# take out the b, home puts the cursor at the start for an X, and delete takes out the a.
# files t.txt=abc
# open t.txt
# frames 8
# expect termline [Xc]
1 key ` ctrl
2 text abc
3 key left
4 key backspace
5 key home
6 text X
7 key delete
